# ── literal-motion · snackbar dwell times ───────────────────────────────────
# RESOLVED BY DELETION AT M11 — NOTHING TO PIN, AND THAT IS THE POINT.
# Six SnackBar `duration:` sites used to fail here (a toast DWELL is not
# animation timing, and `fuzzzyMotion` tops out at 420ms, so no role fit). They
# were deliberately left FAILING rather than pinned, to keep pressure on the
# FuzzzyToast swap. M11 made every one of them disappear — `FuzzzyToast` owns
# its own dwell, so the app no longer states one — and M13 re-verified that
# zero survive. **This block is kept as the worked example**: when no role fits,
# the first question is whether the app should be saying the thing at all. A
# pin would have ended the argument; leaving it red finished the migration.
